sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Underwriter
  participant W as al-web
  participant FS as Firestore
  participant C as core API
  participant L as Ledger
  U->>W: open the loan file
  W->>FS: read application, AI run and ai_calls
  U->>W: approve or decline with a justification
  W->>C: POST /core/applications/{id}/decision
  C->>FS: save decision, status Underwriter Approved or Declined
  U->>W: mint the loan note
  W->>C: POST /core/applications/{id}/mint
  C->>L: mint loan note and store the audit hash
  L-->>C: token ID and transaction hash
  C->>FS: save token ID and hash, status Funded
  FS-->>W: listener updates the loan file
  Note over C,L: The audit pack is available once the loan note is minted.
